flowchart TD
  input[DOCX XLSX PDF Markdown] --> inspect[Inspect format]
  inspect --> parse[Parse source-declared form facts]
  parse --> map[Map typed common core]
  parse --> ext[Map typed namespace extension]
  map --> assemble[Assemble Document Form]
  ext --> assemble
  observe[Renderer or OCR] --> observation[Observation entities]
  observation --> assemble
  assemble --> report[ConversionReport and Diagnostic]
  report --> canonical[Canonical serialization]
  canonical --> query[Query and export]
  canonical --> index[Rebuildable non-authoritative index]
